# Benchmark path "village turns" (tools/ai/README.md "Benchmark states"). Starts where village_walk.nxs ends (the open village). Fixed game
# step (1/60 s per frame): two 300-frame camera turns, then a run with the camera swinging. Windows: the log lines "bench: village_turn1
# start" ... "bench: village_run end" (tools/perf/bench_window.py --turns pools the three).
@rate 60
30
@log bench: village_turn1 start
stick right 1 0 for 300
@log bench: village_turn1 end
30
@log bench: village_turn2 start
stick right -1 0 for 300
@log bench: village_turn2 end
30
@shot turns_mid
@log bench: village_run start
stick left 0 1
stick right 1 0 for 150
stick right -1 0 for 150
stick left 0 0
@log bench: village_run end
30
@shot turns_end
@rate 0
@log bench: village_turns done